<title>JAPAN: Shinko Electric -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinko Electric -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 40.31		vs	   44.68</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1.40		vs	prft 325 million</p>
<p> Current	 loss 2.18		vs   loss 692    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 2.20		vs   loss 717    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 15.07 yen	  vs     loss 4.91 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    146 million	  vs	 146 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinko Electric Co Ltd is a heavy electric machinery maker and belongs to the Kobe Steel Ltd group.</p>
